    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Description of template\n\nThis template is for any user who wants an email assistant to sort out and manage their GMAIL inbox including classifying emails into different categories, drafting responses to emails and extracting financial information from any invoices received to save time and manual effort to keep your GMAIL inbox tidy and manageable.\n\nHow it works\n\nThis template works by using the text classifier to categorise incoming emails into your GMAIL inbox. It then uses ai agents to help create draft emails for a response or extract any financial data that you want to extract from an invoice. \n\nHow to set up \n\n- Use this link https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/google/ to understand how to get the required credentials to use google services\n- Use this link https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/sendemail/gmail/ to understand how to get your SMPT credentials for GMAIL \n\n ",
        "height": 736,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "50733053-b099-4eee-9e7e-ae66b1db35a2",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -3136,
        -112
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "addLabels",
        "messageId": "={{ $('Gmail Trigger1').item.json.id }}",
